OL,5,G1830 The Chase
OL,6,     FBradley Walsh presents as Peter
OL,7,     Ffrom St Albans, Shania from
OL,8,     FHarrow, Medi from Aberystwyth and
OL,9,     FNaeem from Manchester pit their
OL,10,     Fwits against one of the ruthless
OL,11,     Fexperts in the hope of winning a
OL,12,     Fpotential prize pot worth
OL,13,     Fthousands of pounds. They work as
OL,14,     Fa team and play strategically to
OL,15,     Fanswer general knowledge questions
OL,16,     Fagainst the clock and race down
OL,17,     Fthe game board to the exit without
OL,18,     Fbeing caught
