OL,5,G2235 Romesh Ranganathan's Parents'
OL,6,G     Evening
OL,7,     FJoel Dommett and his mum Penny,
OL,8,     FTony Bellew and his son Corey, and
OL,9,     FVicky Pattison and her mum Carroll
OL,10,     Fcompete in the comedy game show
OL,11,     Fwhere success lies in the hands of
OL,12,     Fthe parents. Can Joel overcome his
OL,13,     Fsecond-place curse, will Tony and
OL,14,     FCorey's bickering get the better
OL,15,     Fof them, and could Vicky's past
OL,16,     Fparty lifestyle lead her and her
OL,17,     Fmum to victory? Expect plenty of
OL,18,     Fsurprises that include Romesh's
OL,19,     Fmum Shanthi's method for getting
OL,20,     Faway with murder
